### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Login Fatou
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fatou@innovatech.com",
  "password": "Fatou123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenFatou", response.body.token);
%}

### Fatou crée 2 clients
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFatou}}

{
  "nom": "Diop",
  "prenom": "Aminata",
  "email": "aminata.diop@example.com",
  "telephone": "771234567",
  "ville": "Dakar",
  "pays": "Sénégal"
}

### Fatou voit ses clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenFatou}}